        <body>
            <div xml:id="d316-a1">

                <pb facs="0441" n="325" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg325"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <p>You may inform the Government to which you are accredited, that the United States
                    interprets the convention of 1907 to give it the right: <list>
                        <label>A.</label>
                        <item>To compel the observation of Article III of the convention in the
                            appointment of a financial adviser.</item>
                        <label>B.</label>
                        <item>To provide for the free course of the customs by the organization, on
                            a much larger scale, of what is now known as the Dominican Customs Guard
                            or by the creation of a constabulary.</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
